{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/DX4MrhW-oy8rn1Y3yF9vtw","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T17:02:06.258464+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/DX4MrhW-oy8rn1Y3yF9vtw","html":"<div><section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><strong><span><span>关于接收</span></span></strong></span></p><p><span><strong><span><span>2026年研究生推免生</span></span></strong></span></p><p><span><strong><span><span>预报名的通知</span></span></strong></span><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/VvKzsqugG87jjF4VhW8ywAd99bUG8CPMNiayT2y32ibaDvwPVK4VwWcBk1GDqW56fPYeG8e4t6phAq6klWDsw1gQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>01</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><span><strong><span>申请对象</span></strong></span><span><span> </span></span></span></p></section></section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>1、拥护中国共产党的领导，愿为社会主义现代化建设服务，品德良好，遵纪守法。</span></p><p><span>2、已获得或预计能获得所在高校2025年推荐免试攻读硕士研究生资格的全国大学优秀应届本科毕业生。</span></p><p><span>3、在校期间学习成绩优秀，学术研究兴趣浓厚，有较强的创新意识、创新能力和专业能力倾向。</span></p><p><span>4、诚实守信，学风端正，无任何考试作弊、剽窃他人学术成果及其他违法违纪受处分记录。</span></p><p><span>5、申请人员具有突出的科研能力与潜质。</span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>02</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><span><strong><span>申请材料</span></strong></span><span><span> </span></span></span></p></section></section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>1、简历1份。</span></p><p><span>2、本科阶段成绩单1份。</span></p><p><span>3、能够体现自身英语水平的证件复印件1份（如CET-4、CET-6、IELTS、TOEFL等证书）。</span></p><p><span>4、申请人还可提交获奖证书、体现自身学术水平的代表性学术论文、出版物或原创性工作效果等材料复印件。</span></p><p><span><span>请将上述证明材料制成PDF格式后，压缩成一个zip格式文件并注明</span><span><span>“姓名-本科学校-申请专业-手机号码”</span></span><span>后发到指定邮箱。</span></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>03</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><span><strong><span>申请办法</span></strong></span><span><span> </span></span></span></p></section></section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>1、提交申请材料</span></p><p><span>有意者请于2025年9月20日前将上述要求的电子材料提交到专用邮箱：739196373@qq.com</span></p><p><span>2、资格初审</span></p><p><span>学院研究生招生领导小组对申请进行初审，确认是否接收申请，并请申请者提供准确联系信息，届时学院将通知初审合格的申请者参加复试。</span></p><p><span>3、复试</span></p><p><span>复试采取线上专业面试的方式进行。</span></p><p><span>4、考生身体状况应符合国家规定的体检标准（同普通高等学校招生体检工作指导意见）。</span></p><p><span>5、接受的专业为</span><span><span>社会学学硕、社会工作专硕、新闻传播专硕、国际中文教育专硕。</span></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>04</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><span><strong><span>奖学金体系</span></strong></span><span><span> </span></span></span></p></section></section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>全日制硕士研究生奖助体系包括学业奖学金、国家助学金、国家奖学金、江西省政府奖学金、优秀奖学金、单项奖学金、“三助”岗位津贴等多项奖助学金。</span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>05</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><span><strong><span>注意事项</span></strong></span><span><span> </span></span></span></p></section></section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>1、报名阶段，接受时间从即日起至9月20日止，请有意者尽早报名。</span></p><p><span>2、请申请者务必提供自身准确有效的联系方式、联系邮箱，以免错失机会。</span></p><p><span>3、申请人必须保证提交的全部申请材料的真实性和准确性。我院将对拟录取的推荐免试研究生张榜公示，如果申请人提交的信息不真实或不准确，我校将取消其录取资格或取消其学籍。</span></p><p><span>4、我院2024年获批社会学一级博士点，符合条件的推免生可以优先推荐硕博连读。</span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><section><p><span><strong><span>—END—</span></strong></span><span><span><br/></span></span></p></section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section><p><span><span>编辑|彭智莹</span></span><span><br/></span></p><p><span><span>责编|赵子桐</span></span></p><p><span><span>文字来源|社会与人文学院</span></span></p><p><span><span>图片来源|社会与人文学院</span></span></p><p><span><span>审核|江超颖 殷微微 陈华</span></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/dQmYmNDKb7yCPZy62Yib7VE58RuHNfLUBPAU6QonloyE4ibFIWjUUMe77DT1xV8cia1dfkKKF1FxlDPBbZA4AFkNQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></span></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><span><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/VvKzsqugG87VDtHqjDOGskiaHvDZSeWsdugyDLibXLlgREBWn1vk4nJJM9XQDFVp3p8JVA265InAibibgjNsNhXX8Q/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></span></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><span><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/dQmYmNDKb7yCPZy62Yib7VE58RuHNfLUB79piaLaxk2eKBgCUib28FTZxBkEib8zjWl6b6TEKhVT8yaAb7z1gAEX6g/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></s